
Global settings:
--------------------

Trees:
	-Species trees: 1 Birth-death simulations
		-Speciation rate: Fixed 5.000000e-09,
		-Extinction rate: Fixed 0,
		-Outgroup addition: No addition
		-Stopping rules:
			-Number of leaves: Fixed 25,
			-Generations: LogN(2.125000e+01,2.000000e-01)
	-Locus trees: Fixed 100, locus simulations per species tree 
