		-Loss: Genome-wide parameter: Fixed 9.800000e-10,, Rate: LogN(0.000000e+00,1.000000e+00,GD)
		-Transfer: Genome-wide parameter: Fixed 0.000000e+00,, Rate: LogN(0.000000e+00,1.000000e+00,GT)
		-Gene conversion: Genome-wide parameter: Fixed 0.000000e+00,, Rate: Fixed GG,
		-Transfer (HGT and GC) sampling strategy: Random
		-Minimum number of leaves: 1
		-Minimum number of leaves from different species: 0

	-Gene trees: 1 multilocus coalescent simulations

Parameters:
	-Haploid efective population size: Fixed 10,
	-Generation time: Fixed 1.000000e+00,
	-Global substitution rate: LogN(-2.190000e+01,1.000000e-01)
	-Substitution rate heterogeneities
		-Lineage (species) specific rate heterogeneity gamma shape: LogN(1.500000e+00,1)
		-Gene family (locus tree) specific rate heterogeneity gamma shape: LogN(1.551533e+00,6.931472e-01)
		-Gene tree branch specific rate heterogeneity gamma shape: Genome-wide parameter (hyperhyperparameter) No heterogeneity, locus-tree related parameter No heterogeneity, Gamma parameter(gene-tree related) LogN(1.500000e+00,1)
	-Individuals per species: Fixed 1,

Misc parameters:
